ithub.com/mecattaf/vllm and build it from source against those wheels for GPU target gfx1151 (relax nothing: the torch pin is satisfied exactly; drop audio extras rather than adding torchaudio); COPY container/rootfs/ into site-packages so the fn_ instrument modules land importable; write /opt/flashnext/build-info.json inside the image carrying the fork commit, torch, triton, and image build time. build.sh: run the packaging tests first, then podman build tagged flashnext:dev, then write results/receipts/build.json as {step:\\\"build\\\", status, ts, data:{torch, triton, fork_commit, image_digest}} with status fail on any error. Credit the recipe shape to the MIT toolbox recipe named in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the Containerfile header. Boundaries: touch only container/ and results/receipts/.\",\"id\":\"container-recipe\",\"kind\":\"implementation\",\"readFirst\":{\"specSections\":[\"specs/flashnext/spec.md#r3\",\"IMPORTS.md\",\"specs/flashnext/evidence/kyuz0-rocm10.md\"],\"styleReferences\":[\"scripts/run-smoke.sh\"]},\"revision\":\"sha256:6e8621b55de3a3a9c646edd59fb1c26372db042e230f9d2d3ec5a4e08d329361\",\"title\":\"Container recipe: pinned wheel set + engine fork built from source\"},\"workspace\":{\"baseRev\":\"a428fee66b83d95682b418d5fdb4d975068e66ab\",\"branch\":\"tally-work/flashnext-824b68c09c23/container-recipe\",\"conflictDomains\":[\"container\",\"results/receipts\"],\"publishBranch\":\"tally/flashnext-campaign-01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/container-recipe-6e8621b55de3a3a9\",\"taskId\":\"container-recipe\",\"worktreePath\":\"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/824b68c09c23/container-recipe\"},\"steering\":{\"channel\":\"locally-authorized-snapshot\",\"authorizedComments\":[],\"attemptReceipt\":{\"lateRecheckCommentIds\":[],\"preparedCommentIds\":[],\"recheckTruncated\":false,\"rechecked\":true,\"source\":{\"kind\":\"local-jsonl\",\"path\":\"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/steering/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering-v1.jsonl\",\"preparedCursor\":0,\"recheckedCursor\":0,\"registrationId\":\"01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae\"}},\"machineDiagnoses\":[],\"machineOutcomes\":[]}}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787983542095}]}
