md:634:      tritonKernelsSupport ? true,\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/nix-strix-halo.md:1150:| `xrt-src` / `xdna-driver-src` / `spine-triton` | 2026-06-04 | 85 days |\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/nix-strix-halo.md:1265:   / triton 3.7.1 / cp313 arrive as **prebuilt AMD wheels** [S\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/qsa-53896.md:70:  `NUM_TILES` (`:254-255`), and `NUM_TILES = triton.cdiv(logical_indices.shape[1], block_n)`\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/qsa-53896.md:143:either `tl.range`/`tl.static_range` inside `@triton.jit` bodies or the chunking loop above; zero\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/qsa-53896.md:147:amd/ops/qsa.py:91   for head in tl.static_range(0, NUM_HEADS)       # triton\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/qsa-53896.md:148:amd/ops/qsa.py:251  for tile in range(split_tile_start, ...)        # triton\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/qsa-53896.md:149:amd/ops/qsa.py:508  for group_offset in tl.range(0, COMPRESS_RATIO) # triton\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/moe-dispatch.md:296:in stock** — `kernels/linear/scaled_mm/triton.py:159` **[S]** — but:\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/moe-dispatch.md:301:  `torch.ops.vllm.w8a8_triton_block_scaled_mm_func` — `triton.py:159-177` **[S]**.\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/moe-dispatch.md:609:   `TritonFp8BlockScaledMMKernel` at `kernels/linear/scaled_mm/triton.py:159`, with\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:61:+    N_GATES_PAD: tl.constexpr = triton.next_power_of_2(N_EXPTS_ACT * BLOCK_M)\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:94:It renames the three `@triton.constexpr_function` originals to `_*_uncached`\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:104:> `@triton.jit` body -- nothing in this tree does (verified by grep)\". A Qwen fork\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:156:| `_topk_rows_kernel` | :111-268 | `@triton.jit`, one workgroup per row |\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:304:  falls back), `w8a8_block_fp8_bf16` :396-399 falls back to `w8a8_triton_block_scaled_mm`.\nspecs/flashnext/evidence/ds4-vllm-manifest.md:698:| **Cache dirs off tmpfs (Triton/Inductor)** | `host/ds4-cluster-env.sh:49-50` | `TORCHINDUCTOR_CACHE_DIR=$HOME/.cache/torchinductor`, `TRITON_CACHE_DIR=$HOME/.triton/cache` | :45-48 — \"the defaults land under /tmp (tmpfs), and the first bringup after a boot then recompiles every kernel -- ~25 min CPU-bound in LLVM before the API can answer\" |\n"}],"details":{}}}
