{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_delta","contentIndex":2,"delta":"\n[{\"newText\": \"# The exactly pinned wheel set (IMPORTS.md section 1). The triton pin is the\\n# wheel accompanying the torch 2.13.0 set on the vendor stable index —\\n# verified by pip's own resolver: torch 2.13.0+rocm7.14.0 depends on exactly\\n# triton==3.8.0+git4cff872c.rocm7.14.0 (anything else is ResolutionImpossible).\\n# < 3.8 awareness (IMPORTS.md): the fork's fp8-upcast gate keys on triton < 3.8,\\n# so on this wheel the admission stands but the in-kernel upcast is bypassed —\\n# fp8 dots ride triton 3.8's own lowering, and the fidelity checkpoint grades it.\\nARG TORCH_PIN=\\\"torch==2.13.0+rocm7.14.0\\\"\\nARG TORCHVISION_PIN=\\\"torchvision==0.28.0+rocm7.14.0\\\"\\nARG TRITON_PIN=\\\"triton==3.8.0+git4cff872c.rocm7.14.0\\\"\", \"oldText\": \"# The exactly pinned wheel set (IMPORTS.md section 1). The triton pin is the\\n# wheel accompanying the torch 2.13.0 set on the vendor stable index — the\\n# ROCm build of the triton 3.7.1 that torch 2.13.0 declares (git0263a6a6),\\n# and it sits under the triton < 3.8 gate the fork's fp8-upcast keys on.\\nARG TORCH_PIN=\\\"torch==2.13.0+rocm7.14.0\\\"\\nARG TORCHVISION_PIN=\\\"torchvision==0.28.0+rocm7.14.0\\\"\\nARG TRITON_PIN=\\\"triton==3.7.1+git0263a6a6.rocm7.14.0\\\"\"}]\n\n"}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_delta","contentIndex":2,"delta":", \"path\": \"/home/t"}}
