{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is the missing piece: `amd-torch-device-gfx1151` ships `torch/.kpack/torch_gfx1151.kpack` — a kernel pack containing precompiled device kernels for gfx1151! And it requires `rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151==7.14.0` (yet another device package). The generic torch wheel apparently lazy-loads device kernels from .kpack — so that's why hipErrorInvalidImage is thrown: kernels for gfx1151 weren't installed.\n\nSo, the complete pinned set = torch, torchvision, triton, rocm-sdk-core (+libraries/bootstrap/rocm), plus the device packages: amd-torch-device-gfx1151, amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151, rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151. Check whether the index has rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151? It wasn't shown in the root listing from earlier… What showed up in the root listing were: apex, filelock, fsspec, jax-*, jinja2, markupsafe, mpmath, networkx, numpy, pillow, rocm, rocm-bootstrap, rocm-profiler, rocm-sdk-core, rocm-sdk-devel, rocm-sdk-libraries, setuptools, sympy, torch, torchaudio, torchvision, triton, typing-extensions. No rocm-sdk-device-* at the root… hmm. Maybe the rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151 wheel exists under a different name, or it's provided from the rocm-sdk-libraries wheel? But the Requires-Dist says rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151==7.14.0 — pip would need to resolve it from the index. Let me re-check the root listing (it might have been truncated at head -40… it was filtered with grep -viE device-gfx! I excluded device-gfx lines, but rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151 also contains \"device-gfx\" → got filtered out!). Let me re-check.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The missing piece: device kernel packs. Let me enumerate all device packages on the index:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_080497b3681e4e13b77f4e19","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]+/\"' | grep -E 'device|sdk' ; echo ---; curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]*0\\.28\\.0[^\"]*\"'; curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]*7\\.14[^\"]*\"' | tail -3","timeout":90}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":2764,"output":674,"cacheRead":88704,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":441,"totalTokens":92142,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787986281859,"responseId":"chatcmpl-db80773f-950e-403d-b3f8-e4390b2fd074","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_080497b3681e4e13b77f4e19","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"href=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1010/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1011/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1012/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1030/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1031/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1032/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1033/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1034/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1035/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1036/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx11/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1100/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1101/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1102/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1103/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx110x/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1150/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1151/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1152/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1153/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx115x/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1200/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1201/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1250/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx12-0/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx908/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx90a/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx942/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx950/\"\nhref=\"amd-torchvision-device-gfx1010/\"\nhref=\"amd-torchvision-device-gfx1011/\"\nhref=\"amd-torchvision-device-gfx1012/