n \"3.12.3\") found components: Interpreter Development.Module Development.SABIModule\n      -- Found python matching: /opt/venv/bin/python3.12.\n      Building PyTorch for GPU arch: gfx1151\n      -- The HIP compiler identification is unknown\n      CMake Error at /usr/share/cmake-3.28/Modules/CMakeDetermineHIPCompiler.cmake:217 (message):\n        The ROCm root directory:\n      \n         /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_rocm_sdk_core\n      \n        does not contain the HIP runtime CMake package, expected at one of:\n      \n         /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_rocm_sdk_core/lib/cmake/hip-lang/hip-lang-config.cmake\n         /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_rocm_sdk_core/lib64/cmake/hip-lang/hip-lang-config.cmake\n      \n      Call Stack (most recent call first):\n        /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/share/cmake/Caffe2/public/LoadHIP.cmake:121 (enable_language)\n        /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/share/cmake/Caffe2/Caffe2Config.cmake:74 (include)\n        /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/torch/share/cmake/Torch/TorchConfig.cmake:62 (find_package)\n        CMakeLists.txt:112 (find_package)\n      \n      \n      -- Configuring incomplete, errors occurred!\n      Traceback (most recent call last):\n        File \"/opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_vendor/pyproject_hooks/_in_process/_in_process.py\", line 353, in <module>\n          main()\n        File \"/opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_vendor/pyproject_hooks/_in_process/_in_process.py\", line 335, in main\n          json_out['return_val'] = hook(**hook_input['kwargs'])\n                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n        File \"/opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_vendor/pyproject_hooks/_in_process/_in_process.py\", line 273, in build_editable\n          return hook(wheel_directory, config_settings, metadata_directory)\n                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n   