eel? But the Requires-Dist says rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151==7.14.0 — pip would need to resolve it from the index. Let me re-check the root listing (it might have been truncated at head -40… it was filtered with grep -viE device-gfx! I excluded device-gfx lines, but rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151 also contains \"device-gfx\" → got filtered out!). Let me re-check.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The missing piece: device kernel packs. Let me enumerate all device packages on the index:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_080497b3681e4e13b77f4e19","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]+/\"' | grep -E 'device|sdk' ; echo ---; curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]*0\\.28\\.0[^\"]*\"'; curl -fsSL --max-time 30 \"https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151/\" | grep -oE 'href=\"[^\"]*7\\.14[^\"]*\"' | tail -3","timeout":90}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":2764,"output":674,"cacheRead":88704,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":441,"totalTokens":92142,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787986281859,"responseId":"chatcmpl-db80773f-950e-403d-b3f8-e4390b2fd074","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_080497b3681e4e13b77f4e19","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"href=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1010/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1011/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1012/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1030/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1031/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1032/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1033/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1034/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1035/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1036/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx11/\"\nhref=\"amd-torch-device-gfx1100/\"\nhr